n  FilterFormProps.md, SelectedAssetType.md, SelectedDestinationType.md\n- Rewrite root README.md: remove Installation, APIs, inline code\n  examples, Usage Data, and Supported Properties sections; add a\n  Documentation table linking to all Experience League pages\n- Trim provisioning boilerplate from example READMEs (vanilla-js,\n  react, angular) to a one-line link to Experience League prerequisites\n- Remove generic Angular CLI boilerplate from angular/README.md\n\nMade-with: Cursor\n\n* Update code examples\n\n* Updates\n\n* gitignore update\n\n* Update README.md\n\n* Remove lockfiles\n\n* Update asset-selector.component.ts\n\n* Updates\n\n* Remove Experience League Docs that are beeing adjusted\n\n* Adjust structure to align with latest Experience League; keep minimal setup instructions\n\n* Restore ESM/React/Angular code examples in root README\n\n* Clean-up structure / Re-order\n\n* Update README.md\n\n* Put stubs / references to Experience League from Docs Pages\n\n* Clean-up and make IMS Auth Props and Service links accurate\n\n* Refine root Readme\n\n* Clean-up root Readme\n\n* ASSETS-66838: [Content Advisor] 3P GA - Example Repo Updates\n\n* Clean-up examples including terminology, and reduce extra styles\n\n* Refine and clean-up docs and examples\n\n* Update remaining examples and references\n\n* PR Feedback Updates","tree":{"sha":"b1535f28c2421ec37b4f60d2e4d25c8b2f9e03ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adobe/aem-assets-selectors-mfe-examples/git/trees/b1535f28c2421ec37b4f60d2e4d25c8b2f9e03ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adobe/aem-assets-selectors-mfe-examples/git/commits/6b754c72893a5090e49de0bcbef1d570aaa42b7d","verification":{"payload":"tree b1535f28c2421ec37b4f60d2e4d25c8b2f9e03ae\nparent 5cfaf38c0f965b6481a35cd2554b00a7a7bb2e26\nauthor mbriscoe-adobe <156943116+mbriscoe-adobe@users.noreply.github.com> 1781024502 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781024502 -0600\n\nUpdate Code Examples and Consolidate Docs (with references 