thub-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/commits/2c64a16002c3cbe75078daaf42640326ff114aa1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T01:51:05Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T01:51:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(changesets): version packages (#690)\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"433534a7a01c44d7ee584cead6972e4054328ef3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/git/trees/433534a7a01c44d7ee584cead6972e4054328ef3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/git/commits/2c64a16002c3cbe75078daaf42640326ff114aa1","verification":{"payload":"tree 433534a7a01c44d7ee584cead6972e4054328ef3\nparent 779bb3f05b6b711ebb88f2f49d470109e93aa34b\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1787795465 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787795465 -0400\n\nci(changesets): version packages (#690)\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqj5gJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4O0QAHqu4TGFthCpiYaDxcdK5Bqf\nTXoC102pml8jyXy0AQOA+bXbC8lCdRXWNvLBjejmjMYJESTrj1CLkVoFjJ4YA1hw\nSDivwBpmB9yLIozgnte3PPTaz1NUoCAaSwJqDAjt/xQCEfg05YjQuQQDnAN05g+H\nAg15isS4T30NwxoOCcnEX8u00mjPRu2gtl1LFxKS8yTqnZye58nPWEb6AN5OMOJJ\nVMHgjUgaRr4qOEVdg0Qj+Rrxs5vf6JMe0p03RGqhzk5epw7