df31527c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/commits/c46e44bc58cd2a4633d1bbb1b37a30f9df31527c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/794579?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/patricklafrance","id":794579,"login":"patricklafrance","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NDU3OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/commits/9ad83bb34e71d64e76b7f2a390f4da3ef2ebcf87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T02:58:30Z","email":"patricklafrance@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Patrick Lafrance"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T02:58:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): update outdated dependencies (#639)\n\n* chore(deps): update outdated dependencies\n\nRan `pnpm update-outdated-deps` + reset/reinstall, with these deliberate holds and fixes:\n\n- Held `typescript` at 6.0.3 — `@workleap/eslint-configs@2.0.4` peers `^6.0.3` and `typescript-eslint` crashes on TS7; `tsgo` remains the typechecker.\n- Adopted `@workleap/webpack-configs@1.6.15` and restored `webpack` to 5.108.4 — 1.6.15 creates `DefinePlugin` from `compiler.webpack`, fixing the pnpm dual-instance `Compilation` crash.\n- Held `webpack-dev-server` at 5.2.4 — blocked upstream by `@pmmmwh/react-refresh-webpack-plugin` (wds peer `^4.8.0 || 5.x`).\n- Converted the `TraceFlags` enum to a `const` object for `erasableSyntaxOnly` (`@workleap/typescript-configs@5`).\n\nAlso carries the pre-existing `packageManager` bump to pnpm 11.5.0.\n\nQA: build, lint, and test all green; basic, basic-webpack, and endpoints samples validated in a browser (React Router 8 routing, module federation, MSW, auth, error boundaries).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(changeset): bump react-router-peer packages to major\n\nReact Router''s peer requirement moved from ^7.15.0 to ^8.2.0 — a breaking change\nfor consumers. Per the repo precedent (#240, RR v6→v7 = major), @squide/firefly,\n@squide/react-router, @squide/firefly-module-federation, and @squide/firefly-storybook\nare now major instead of patch. Addresses the automated review finding on #639.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd1a46e9244a2d7ce1a809a74561fff564806210","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/git/trees/cd1a46e9244a2d7ce1a809a74561fff564806210"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/git/commits/9ad83bb34e71d64e76b7f2a390f4da3ef2ebcf87","verification":{"payload":"tree cd1a46e9244a2d7ce1a809a74561fff564806210\nparent 785d44e815efd9d03dd77414449307ad2b7d73f6\nauthor Patrick Lafrance <patricklafrance@users.noreply.github.com> 1783738710 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783738710 -0400\n\nchore(deps): update outdated dependencies (#639)\n\n* chore(deps): update outdated dependencies\n\nRan `pnpm update-outdated-deps` + reset/reinstall, with these deliberate holds and fixes:\n\n- Held `typescript` at 6.0.3 — `@workleap/eslint-configs@2.0.4` peers `^6.0.3` and `typescript-eslint` crashes on TS7; `tsgo` remains the typechecker.\n- Adopted `@workleap/webpack-configs@1.6.15` and restored `webpack` to 5.108.4 — 1.6.15 creates `DefinePlugin` from `compiler.webpack`, fixing the pnpm dual-instance `Compilation` crash.\n- Held `webpack-dev-server` at 5.2.4 — blocked upstream by `@pmmmwh/react-refresh-webpack-plugin` (wds peer `^4.8.0 || 5.x`).\n- Converted the `TraceFlags` enum to a `const` object for `erasableSyntaxOnly` (`@workleap/typescript-configs@5`).\n\nAlso carries the pre-existing `packageManager` bump to pnpm 11.5.0.\n\nQA: build, lint, and test all green; basic, basic-webpack, and endpoints samples validated in a browser (React Router 8 routing, module federation, MSW, auth, error boundaries).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(changeset): bump react-router-peer packages to major\n\nReact Router''s peer requirement moved from ^7.15.0 to ^8.2.0 — a breaking change\nfor consumers. Per the repo precedent (#240, RR v6→v7 = major), @squide/firefly,\n@squide/react-router, @squide/firefly-module-federation, and @squide/firefly-storybook\nare now major instead of patch. Addresses the automated review finding on #639.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUbFWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAk8UQAHSq3LNOpioi1IcpaXzG6maa\nDINcPZ9ysJxxZJ15GoyAQTWORcIhdOEQaB6Ir1VSQtGO7jPaJdWFiOXLxPiKdoKt\nRF7s12JSHt+L8g86HNI14/Ck8zF5GJMhObpTvFCCQRagkqZ45AJ0DytnWyfNQgkP\n36fAPGNxtJGTkqW0p5saqDBOSqrvMMnqV8SZTmJtWMgmy0Bc5akRcVc75EPFPx1l\ndLth9Edb86BPuft55iVCcTKHkZP/VcIN0X3kPQvd5Hjru0q7YOq50uKuRuh1x/q/\nT5f5Ssmwy5YLVEvCcZCqWJhL4/N85AFxHLCZmnBWxriPx1y+xuQbNxYf+oargTD9\nROn4q/0NvvliOug+DN2x7BEr3j59YPkSQ9HQBb4pzw3vspRyQ/QnyYIb9fZp41nz\n26HnEzI1nvqBAeaNZZhy/jqLgGF7mQ9oXtD076znb9d8X4+kAvCkq6P8sGjoBZhW\nq+L7P3ciFx+9f74Dxhrlo3MVh0QeMrP9KsmBjwTmgreqZEos