:"https://github.com/workleap/wl-squide/commit/785d44e815efd9d03dd77414449307ad2b7d73f6","node_id":"C_kwDOJbZi_NoAKDc4NWQ0NGU4MTVlZmQ5ZDAzZGQ3NzQxNDQ0OTMwN2FkMmI3ZDczZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/workleap/wl-squide/commit/9bbcd7e1597d0c473a1477f608e3596390553bb4","sha":"9bbcd7e1597d0c473a1477f608e3596390553bb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/commits/9bbcd7e1597d0c473a1477f608e3596390553bb4"}],"sha":"785d44e815efd9d03dd77414449307ad2b7d73f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/commits/785d44e815efd9d03dd77414449307ad2b7d73f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/794579?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/patricklafrance","id":794579,"login":"patricklafrance","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NDU3OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/commits/9bbcd7e1597d0c473a1477f608e3596390553bb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:11:21Z","email":"patricklafrance@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Patrick Lafrance"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:11:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(msw): add prepend option to registerRequestHandlers (#631)\n\n* feat(msw): add position option to registerRequestHandlers\n\nMSW evaluates handlers in registration order and a resolver returning\nnothing falls through to the next matching handler. Middleware-like\nhandlers (artificial latency, request logging, chaos testing) therefore\nmust be registered before the regular handlers — but Squide registers\nlocal modules concurrently, so registry order depends on import timing\nand cannot be controlled by consumers today.\n\nregisterRequestHandlers now accepts { position: \"start\" | \"end\" }\n(default \"end\"). Start handlers are returned before end handlers;\nregistration order is preserved within each group.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(msw): rename position option to hoist-style prepend flag\n\nAligns with the registerRoute precedent (RegisterRouteOptions.hoist?: true)\nrather than introducing a new two-value position vocabulary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(msw): address Copilot review wording comments (#631)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"30daa919bd4cff11f0bb1b39025d8ef731196dc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/git/trees/30daa919bd4cff11f0bb1b39025d8ef731196dc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/git/commits/9bbcd7e1597d0c473a1477f608e3596390553bb4","verification":{"payload":"tree 30daa919bd4cff11f0bb1b39025d8ef731196dc4\nparent 0e88f365f43c24bd8c40ae1b41781a641da14b7c\nauthor Patrick Lafrance <patricklafrance@users.noreply.github.com> 1781118681 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781118681 -0400\n\nfeat(msw): add prepend option to registerRequestHandlers (#631)\n\n* feat(msw): add position option to registerRequestHandlers\n\nMSW evaluates handlers in registration order and a resolver returning\nnothing falls through to the next matching handler. Middleware-like\nhandlers (artificial latency, request logging, chaos testing) therefore\nmust be registered before the regular handlers — but Squide registers\nlocal modules concurrently, so registry order depends on import timing\nand cannot be controlled by consumers today.\n\nregisterRequestHandlers now accepts { position: \"start\" | \"end\" }\n(default \"end\"). Start handlers are returned before end handlers;\nregistration order is preserved within each group.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(msw): rename position option to hoist-style prepend flag\n\nAligns with the registerRoute precedent (RegisterRouteOptions.hoist?: true)\nrather than introducing a new two-value position vocabulary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(msw): address Copilot review wording comments (#631)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKbbZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARaUQAJ2TAJx1pS4EAJ51lqv8iD2+\n0JkIMyBqlCdTheybMU50syU+w+OiyVqYO74Xk/N0ohSj0jjm22349uJN8ujldIe2\n1zRNtTgC9tBGC4UK5ZLO01rs0diJnAUAZ5iujxO5vRy8t+Cdj6C36H9jLi/ggzpY\npiZJdXi9O+P39l45jzLtMCY2AjOj0jsfYXhPqRO1UFwJ70FDkA/gX9lI8982yz9p\nuiRAQu9u6zDnPNGDEvvjMBg0XFq7L5oGY8o4FnbjPPDCC7SmZ8vBRP/Uw80IIL4H\nZTY5T2/SZ5vKaMJ8j5dSwlVc6njNiZFWPG0PbQQG2UgD7zvNPmECoiUyVXZeZ4Az\nGOvDho2fu13N4F8Mf8HYHcqZRiuDRuzdNWIXjP4JhbkalGooJJ9VVmaH13Q63/XD\nKLViAKQ5VDltuLWLGYaM8kniYaQt8Ekz/oHChRgSuCYZaXLBIHq3GhRvio7rGBVN\nN+CDPTEfSOJj1J0MSy7GrDll+tleoPZB3Wm5WjiWDHQhFQr3FXWcUl/OtnunRh3Y\nNm/VFycrrwZsJJtcEPdz1mvQo982jlw80qFqk02WFZHZiXEqHFYsvseXnaGxr9a6\nI/iz+XwNZga5Omu4TZeDEZKYpxf+9gnv+baZOuGVVjXLA7VB2ToQnNdb5nbjIzFm\nwCEm/65CV+4BEoFUeLEu\n=vQru\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T19:11:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?