vacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/patricklafrance","id":794579,"login":"patricklafrance","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NDU3OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patricklafrance","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/commits/732e274927823684e448f131d1e068c42c13dd47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T04:00:30Z","email":"patricklafrance@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Patrick Lafrance"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T04:00:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(firefly-storybook): allow customizing the decorator''s mounted route (#620)\n\nAdd `route` and `initialEntries` options to `FireflyDecorator` and\n`withFireflyDecorator` so stories can attach a route `handle` (read via\n`useMatches()`) and child routes (for `<Outlet />`). The `route` option\nreplaces the default `{ path: \"/story\", element: story }`; existing call\nsites are unaffected.\n\n`registeredRoutes` is intentionally not exposed: `StorybookRuntime.registerRoute()`\nis a no-op, so route registration is always empty under a StorybookRuntime.\n\nAddresses #619.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9bf90cf97eed57ba863a202533656d4dfcdf84f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/git/trees/9bf90cf97eed57ba863a202533656d4dfcdf84f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/workleap/wl-squide/git/commits/732e274927823684e448f131d1e068c42c13dd47","verification":{"payload":"tree 9bf90cf97eed57ba863a202533656d4dfcdf84f3\nparent 46bd06c5000a6f56abda37c97ebb29de6b489d90\nauthor Patrick Lafrance <patricklafrance@users.noreply.github.com> 1780113630 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780113630 -0400\n\nfeat(firefly-storybook): allow customizing the decorator''s mounted route (#620)\n\nAdd `route` and `initialEntries` options to `FireflyDecorator` and\n`withFireflyDecorator` so stories can attach a route `handle` (read via\n`useMatches()`) and child routes (for `<Outlet />`). The `route` option\nreplaces the default `{ path: \"/story\", element: story }`; existing call\nsites are unaffected.\n\n`registeredRoutes` is intentionally not exposed: `StorybookRuntime.registerRoute()`\nis a no-op, so route registration is always empty under a StorybookRuntime.\n\nAddresses #619.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGmDeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAG8wQAEXfMkBRibZbmZWeTNSDvFaH\n839pgeiKWXBWzgiSkDLLwEfu0e5D27K8JnnP64+MsTCszXQtSmorqVbUB0SQVtJP\ndsebiY6TgAlLn7EVh//Cc3NDJXcsyTqA48yPo3HHQbY7sZhQSo6GelO5vf6LUxwp\nxoy94d37Hr8enCE9c7c6PcYppf81+aAe+LSA1YOl/wYmsI913YBA9uoT+K4V2lnv\n++YOUU3+We9cUYUGe8qDumZa+QJMIZ0Kjm+1AI+dfAldp/CAUPvuVyosk826Fhqc\nSABNMOh1gdHvFyVUAZFeqU6j2VCNfHsUcUW2PBGJlNYPivBm/ZeG4MDqS6TEPF8a\n3REE2gWdtfVEUu0T1qDyEaWgTwBwtrmXcVgjKnEDTcav3aEu50fnb3KZaDmvf8yw\nAuEiw3sjmYwwCHCyjw5/YgKjKVxc3Gvh6YZcx9zSUNE/BSkcpFyP7T2cVCyaAqzZ\n8BssU+sAYmRqlQ6dVVaciSM7l5cPQd+byT+/lo67zEDOqbYiZ0a2v2tmNjrsIZXy\nE61ghIvyqFnbhptGyEggEdd7AB6iUiM9s1Q0Jagwo5okadQ8a55yzMzL9rr7anRj\nV59eYO9EjfnDlbjahUH6RKco/86MCJrIt7phrg3dfE9XmWb8+3oLsk5KZ1tADt0Y\npVdibEBYDcxFy695oqU0\n=1fWZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-30T04:00:31Z"}},"commi