eQueryUrl` for constructing file query URLs in `DataViewer`\n\n* Fix `DataViewer` container styling to ensure proper positioning, z-index, and scrollability\n\n* Update image path in `FallbackPage` to use correct directory structure\n\n* Update `Row.tsx` to adjust `DataViewer` URL path for consistent routing\n\n* Remove unnecessary dependency `loading` from `useEffect` in `TextViewer`\n\n* Add utility function `TextQueryUrl` for constructing text query URLs in `DataViewer`\n\n* Refactor `TextViewer` and `NexusViewer` to use `h5Api` for API requests, replacing manual fetch calls\n\n* Add `monkey.webp` image to `container/images` directory\n\n* Update `DataViewer` container comments for clarity on `scigateway` context","tree":{"sha":"bbea3d8509df58f3ddc0f324409a7c7b5c6fee6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fiaisis/frontend/git/trees/bbea3d8509df58f3ddc0f324409a7c7b5c6fee6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fiaisis/frontend/git/commits/3b5588c89b3a56bdf3006c95ca0269dff3164190","verification":{"payload":"tree bbea3d8509df58f3ddc0f324409a7c7b5c6fee6f\nparent b47068954fe94616fffd51464bbc3030a6ba6475\nauthor keiranjprice101 <44777678+keiranjprice101@users.noreply.github.com> 1773676198 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773676198 +0000\n\nMigrata data viewer to frontend (#656)\n\n* Refactor: clean up imports and improve code readability by compacting multi-line statements\n\n* Add `TextViewer` component for fetching and displaying text files\n\n* Add `NexusViewer` component for rendering HDF5 files with H5Web app\n\n* Add `Fallback` component for error handling with basic UI\n\n* Add `DataViewer` page to handle routing and render appropriate viewers\n\n* Add routes for `DataViewer` and compact multi-line `createRoute` statement\n\n* Add utility function `FileQueryUrl` for constructing file query URLs in `DataViewer`\n\n* Fix `DataViewer` container styling to ensure proper positioning, z-index, and scrollability\n\n* Update image path in `FallbackPage` to