zlauskas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkazlauskas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/lace/commits/2137003a545d3f46712ed2c8da72d57f43bb7daa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-12T16:40:20Z","email":"martynas@firmfirm.co","name":"Martynas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T16:40:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: register runtime.onConnect synchronously on SW startup [LW-14540] (#2188)\n\n* chore: bump cardano-js-sdk\n\n* fix: register runtime.onConnect synchronously on SW startup\n\nWhen the service worker is woken by a content script connection,\nthe runtime.onConnect listener was not yet registered because it\nwas set up lazily inside the dynamically imported modules. This\ncaused the first DApp connector call to fail.\n\nCall getBackgroundMessenger synchronously before the dynamic import\nso the listener is in place immediately. The singleton ensures all\nlater exposeApi calls reuse the same messenger instance.","tree":{"sha":"4e940a883919c65fec4b0d303435e1172c35fef0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/lace/git/trees/4e940a883919c65fec4b0d303435e1172c35fef0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/lace/git/commits/2137003a545d3f46712ed2c8da72d57f43bb7daa","verification":{"payload":"tree 4e940a883919c65fec4b0d303435e1172c35fef0\nparent cc36e5dd7294975ccdafcc63495dc870ea743438\nauthor Martynas <martynas@firmfirm.co> 1773333620 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773333620 +0200\n\nfix: register runtime.onConnect synchronously on SW startup [LW-14540] (#2188)\n\n* chore: bump cardano-js-sdk\n\n* fix: register runtime.onConnect synchronously on SW startup\n\nWhen the service worker is woken by a content script connection,\nthe runtime.onConnect listener was not yet registered because it\nwas set up lazily inside the dynamically imported modules. This\ncaused the first DApp connector call to fail.\n\nCall getBackgroundMessenger synchronously before the dynamic import\nso the listener is in place immediately. The singleton ensures all\nlater exposeApi calls reuse the same messenger instance.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpsux0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAN2gQAKN6AHSSFElMsIMC3AUr0cZX\n0QPqVW06slWtFjdki1HrDg7LK3tIzsJToFq52EUJdv4U7cActSE70oMIxeRVmlfD\nBhVm2uflyYYbhlNopMZhR5Ckxp7aCa0GH9+DRvY9hE2Mp8UIOqt8bwrHnV4VpsfO\no3kXqnypdwqH+j5xvx0tFXSNX58xKHESwE+G2on4bC6d96ghF8oUgP0iGL/s0RUw\nonkGPBcAwov9/f39XbI7QY/61Fr/AhaCXjBlGs8btHMs9QOuHYzznSXnNoZ58a7B\ncSFCcLvyvCP7pEg1BitzkUuFKD8dma9SGCgneaah0oUdLNvgLcHMwfN5Mu/r5dUP\ncVUdeaQu/jRN3UZFaz4OMRyVXgWHOMYe3AQaEUmiCIuakAiwgsMpiPnG/0DfmsIc\n9UdJJ3xMfWiEB7zDYaxKeWNK9RWBSHHsWjYJ3lofupYd+Mul7c2PfavcRP0wLgxj\nuH41ml6Z3Zsk9Q9kjP0FVX4HtK6ZOSMIy64ahjZtjKx4OOTM1cYFP1VK2FB81neS\npTX3b8imwrkBaKBB7iI/abFI1/aT5WPeQoQZ2umocDKVD564ddT1Xy7VnJs0mpVH\ny/RVhRMwRVu3rPk3A9x6tOZrJkk7CbTXM9HCCzQJe+zf87gnrRx2GfTHMR9B6LGs\nZ1VuvSqXweZUxzgZTYbn\n=a0iu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-12T16:40:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"htt