f chrome.* api with webextension-polyfill\n\n* fix: initialize cip30 with non-nullable wallet observable\n\nObservable<ObservableWallet> is the type declared in sdk\n\n* fix: do not connect content scripts to SW until api enable() is called\n\nbump cardano-js-sdk and v2","tree":{"sha":"3186111496b7d1184ca6ce791f0599bf4740ca79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/lace/git/trees/3186111496b7d1184ca6ce791f0599bf4740ca79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/lace/git/commits/3f17b89e68b0b1acf2cb21668bdb64ab1197621c","verification":{"payload":"tree 3186111496b7d1184ca6ce791f0599bf4740ca79\nparent 3a19b4eece869981a16bb6b1dc1dabcfef969115\nauthor Martynas <martynas@firmfirm.co> 1772458110 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772458110 +0200\n\nFix/keep sw dead [LW-14449] [LW-14490] (#2170)\n\n* fix: remove web extension event listener in useEffect cleanup function\n\n* feat: remove global web request failure tracking\n\nextension event listeners wake up SW on any web request in the browser\n\n* feat: disable manual session management as poll controller\n\nbrowser will kill extension after ~30s of inactivity which\nmakes manual poll controller almost useless\n\nimplementation of manual poll controller relied on web extension\nevents which woke up the extension while Lace wasn''t used\n\n* feat: remove nami mode\n\nkeep nami migration\n\n* refactor: replace direct usage of chrome.* api with webextension-polyfill\n\n* fix: initialize cip30 with non-nullable wallet observable\n\nObservable<ObservableWallet> is the type declared in sdk\n\n* fix: do not connect content scripts to SW until api enable() is called\n\nbump cardano-js-sdk and v2","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJppZB+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARVAQAHsxQMG5onwBwAJ6KCO0+bKO\nnkiAT6lD6pTWJhrQhRrGphDxUKV0gvpaQuAH1tYLSAfgmE3O0BTqmlkUG7qqyk7k\nfCgVKa24Mk9rpfwFFvuSwhYPB9kMHgITDzu8Cfrqgs2eI1H1PFU/S22bIWUUKcb9\n1AAEDusN+qLXqogOl5Bb06JXmABIzRXoNZ49XcRaQ