1dbb011d98e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T10:08:38Z","email":"rhys.bartelswaller@iohk.io","name":"Rhys Bartels-Waller"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T10:08:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: correctly extract token price when asset is quote token in pool (#2172)\n\nThe GeckoTerminal /tokens/{id}/pools endpoint may return the queried\ntoken as either the base or quote token. Previously we always used\nbase_token_price_native_currency, which returned the wrong price for\ntokens like USDCx that appear as the quote token in their primary pool.\n\nNow we check the pool''s base_token relationship to determine which\nprice field to use.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"f24f0b8e55d4228c949d1295eb78a6b341114e03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/lace/git/trees/f24f0b8e55d4228c949d1295eb78a6b341114e03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/lace/git/commits/59bb178c00d7b7017a88502ebe3dc1dbb011d98e","verification":{"payload":"tree f24f0b8e55d4228c949d1295eb78a6b341114e03\nparent bd48dd261cdc4b314005c7b14534fc6685f3451b\nauthor Rhys Bartels-Waller <rhys.bartelswaller@iohk.io> 1772446118 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772446118 +0000\n\nfix: correctly extract token price when asset is quote token in pool (#2172)\n\nThe GeckoTerminal /tokens/{id}/pools endpoint may return the queried\ntoken as either the base or quote token. Previously we always used\nbase_token_price_native_currency, which returned the wrong price for\ntokens like USDCx that appear as the quote token in their primary pool.\n\nNow we check the pool''s base_token relationship to determine which\nprice field to use.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJppWGmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgpEQAHSbWyr9vg/sf0HPHq1XOZCw\n9V9fJXxrtnn28x8wIpanMxAqbPV6pllXwIHwJZZ6dnPhXNIDG74JlTeM2Mk9K4xT\nivIdXL8Tgr/jYoedjcp0vxKRAL4LNnTgXgwRK9RtwhCOyZPIbXCf877lnaXtnuIV\nq