ers/DominikGuzei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DominikGuzei/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DominikGuzei","id":172414,"login":"DominikGuzei","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQxNA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DominikGuzei/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DominikGuzei/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DominikGuzei/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DominikGuzei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DominikGuzei/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DominikGuzei","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/lace/commits/21673d6a4b26e319889eb175786575d97f454cf2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-11T12:34:21Z","email":"dominik.guzei@gmail.com","name":"Dominik Guzei"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-11T12:34:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: redirect directly to v1 on Midnight wallet removal (#2109)\n\nPreviously, removing the last Midnight wallet would briefly flash the\nonboarding screen before redirecting to v1. This happened because both\nonboarding-extension and lmp-bundle had side-effects triggering on\nwallet removal.\n\nIntroduces a config addon pattern allowing lmp-bundle to disable the\nonboarding redirect specifically on wallet/account removal, while\npreserving normal onboarding behavior for fresh app loads.","tree":{"sha":"48dfe067eaddd1205227a7eda131253149e7034b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/lace/git/trees/48dfe067eaddd1205227a7eda131253149e7034b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/lace/git/commits/21673d6a4b26e319889eb175786575d97f454cf2","verification":{"payload":"tree 48dfe067eaddd1205227a7eda131253149e7034b\nparent 899cea2e8edea90f3a64e8f4a9128be2997b7ae7\nauthor Dominik Guzei <dominik.guzei@gmail.com> 1765456461 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1765456461 +0000\n\nfix: redirect directly to v1 on Midnight wallet removal (#2109)\n\nPreviously, removing the last Midnight wallet would briefly flash the\nonboarding screen before redirecting to v1. This happened because both\nonboarding-extension and lmp-bundle had side-effects triggering on\nwallet removal.\n\nIntroduces a config addon pattern allowing lmp-bundle to disable the\nonboarding redirect specifically on wallet/account removal, while\npreserving normal onboarding behavior for fresh app loads.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpOrpNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXS0QAIHME209qk+13mqMXz0yXYgn\nJyaRC+3mABBr/dPqBQX14ETqeh1i1nuT434A7Q4S0XQMoLhj39JEk2FxMKBthYeq\nK2UCJSrCOKhiQ5b1zA4JI8ZqgHMf5MguGagzTA814t46elBtQAXMLCVJ5pfwKLme\nmQqh0RUA99M0UFHsmnm7pd+0KoEur3uVNsCfnbTE/SpBBOlFQIjKM+oOQCFZ7q3i\ngtJwGe+sj/yc7qndULr9LCfB5nH0ErYGA7rG1C1SBZSWkZZ2W2vr4ExFKslFEsjY\n+AUAT2irLBIJJtRvaZc4QSjDPeZqg1wmKhXjFcdP1ew+8B4aGRCvU7M3KufHF1GH\nikz2igZp1Ou85XBWIOXs4+oTkAwo4+blCnqfeGjaDnc+tcX5MM/NzhsnQN+2NyIw\nD+k76rrXoI9JITM0H8QQ7Fq9Id91w2E/7mb4OHYpSVPh98dsq5YMijnCDQ2cWDBe\nFz5+CFukSLkAOWRqxsaBzM9OLDlKtlCB7vZ6bLdq2Xtn6gyHP/zkkFx+TmQUsM+D\n/zJCj6GhpOGj2rXCxYm29dq1RwoExb0cWxIxZ//cxSSG8adSm3arf3gxHaoCQzED\n7E/asGMy9De4LYrGM9MUn+GMJ4pYjG5A5lcwRo0ReHaqHEJx9d0T8vgW73YF+VLV\nSWa/gFrlTUSDO6axURpI\n=nlGf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-11T12:34:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":